##########
##SET UP##
##########
Do 

conda activate /mnt/dv/wid/projects7/Roy-singlecell2/yuda_work/envs/IBPG/

or consult step 1~3 in https://github.com/Roy-lab/tgif/tree/main?tab=readme-ov-file#install

###########
## usage ##
###########
for help,
./tetraNMF -h

For the arguments following -t, 
-t recur 
means factorize X into AP and then factorize A into UV^T, and P into WH^T.
-t nmqf
means doing nmtf-style 4-factor NMF

#############
## Example ##
#############
./tetraNMF -d test_inputs/exp.txt \
-r test_inputs/tfs.txt \
-g test_inputs/targets.txt \
-p test_inputs/prior.txt \
-o test_inputs/out \
-t recur \
--k_1 8 --k_2 8 \
--num_rep 2 \
--max_iter 300


